<title>USA: Silver Lake, Wis., $2 mln won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Silver Lake, Wis., $2 mln won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin, Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc., said it won $2.650 million of Silver Lake Sanitary District, Wis., general obligation refunding bonds, series 1996A, with a true interest cost of 5.31 percent.</p>
</text>
